	"nodes":[
		{"id":"42a21ed9fb20388d","type":"text","text":"## Risk\n\nEffect of uncertain future events on an organisation (such as profit).\n\n#### Operational Risk\n\nRisk of **losses** resulting from **failed** **people**, **systems**, **internal** **policies** and procedures, **external** **events** that effect operations.\n\nExamples include **human** **error**, **internal fraud**, **rogue trading**, **IT failures**, **contractual disputes**\n\n[[L4 Operational Risk.canvas]]\n\n#### Compliance Risk\n\nRisk a **company** **fails** to **comply** with applicable **laws**, rules, regulations resulting in legal **sanctions**, **penalties**, **reputation** damage etc.\n\n#### Investment Risk\n\nThe **risk** associated with **investing** that arises from **fluctuations** in value of **assets**.","x":-420,"y":-280,"width":800,"height":660}
	],
	"edges":[]
}